{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星Galaxy S27 Ultra和傳聞中的Galaxy S27 Pro電池近日出現在韓國Safety Korea認證數據庫，相關頁面公開了電池照片及型號。電池型號分別為EB-BS958DBY和EB-BS957CBY，與此前報道的S27 Ultra和S27 Pro手機型號SM-S958、SM-S957相對應，供應商均為中國珠海冠宇電池。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583500.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.309810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:13:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:08.951755+00:00","content_hash":"0601f97300b2cca4a6faf1e8cc92aed043c291c9e0f57c893e4e15dd625a5e34","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}